iza and Reese. So no, that\'s not helpful. So the only way to get to Eden is through Oliver, because Oliver is directly connected to Eden.\n\nSo the shortest path is Caro -> Oliver -> Eden. So Caro should pass to Oliver first.\n\nWait, but let me double-check. Is there any other path through Reese that\'s shorter? Let\'s see: Caro -> Reese -> Shae -> Aliza -> Eileen -> Rodney -> Shae... No, that\'s looping. Alternatively, Caro -> Reese -> Aliza -> Eileen -> Rodney -> Shae... Still not getting to Eden.\n\nSo the only direct connection to Eden is through Oliver. Therefore, the shortest path is Caro -> Oliver -> Eden. So Caro should pass to Oliver first.\n</think>\n\ncaroline -> oliver -> eden\n\noliver'  correct=oliver
