dney. So from Eileen to Rodney to Shae. Then Shae is friends with Shae? No, Shae is friends with Aliza and Rodney. Wait, maybe Shae is friends with someone else. Let me check the connections again.\n\nLooking back, Shae is friends with Aliza and Rodney. So from Eileen to Rodney to Shae, but Shae isn't connected to anyone else except Aliza and Rodney. So Shae can't reach Oliver directly. Wait, but Oliver is friends with Caro琳 and Edne. So maybe from Shae, we can go to Edne? Wait, no, Shae is friends with Rodney, who is friends with Edne. So from Shae to Rodney to Edne. Then Edne is friends with Caro琳 and Shae. Wait, no, Edne is friends with Caro琳 and Shae. So from Edne to Caro琳, but Caro琳 is already in the path. Alternatively, from Edne to Shae, but that's the same as before.\n\nWait, maybe I'm missing something. Let me try to map it out step by step.\n\nFrom Aliza, the first step is to Eileen or Caro琳.\n\nIf she goes to Eileen, then Eileen is connected to Rodney and Shae. From Eileen to Rodney, then Rodney is connected to Shae. From Shae, where can we go? Shae is friends with Rodney and Aliza. So from Shae, we can't go further unless we go back to Rodney or Aliza. But we need to reach Oliver, who is connected to Caro琳 and Edne.\n\nWait, maybe from Rodney, who is connected to Shae and Eileen. From Rodney, we can go to Edne. Edne is friends with Caro琳 and Shae. So from Edne to Caro琳, but Caro琳 is already in the path. Alternatively, from Edne to Shae, but that's the same as before.\n\nHmm, maybe I'm not considering all connections. Let me check the connections again.\n\nLooking at the connections:\n\n- Aliza is friends with Eileen, Caro琳, Reesee.\n- Caro琳 is friends with Reesee, Shae, Aliza.\n- Reesee is friends with Caro琳, Shae, Aliza.\n- Shae is friends with Aliza, Rodney, Reesee.\n- Rodney is friends with Shae, Eileen.\n- Eileen is friends with Aliza, Rodney, Shae.\n- Edne is friends with Caro琳, Shae, Montserrat.\n- Montserrat is friends with Edne, Yitzchak.\n- Yitz