e is two steps, while Tiff route is four steps. So the shortest path is through Nevaeh.\n\nWait, but wait, is there a shorter path through Em? Because Em is directly connected to Yitta. So from Nevaeh, we can go to Em, which is connected to Yitta. So that\'s two steps from Faiga: Nevaeh -> Em -> Yitta.\n\nYes, that\'s the shortest path. So Faiga should pass to Nevaeh first.\n</think>\n\nthe shortest path is faiga -> nevaeh -> empress -> yitta. the correct option is nevaeh.\n\nnevaeh'  correct=tiffany
