o Hafsa is better.\n\nWait, but maybe I missed something. Let me check the connections again. From Prince, friends are Sulaiman and Hafsa. Sulaiman is friends with Maimouna and connor. Maimouna is friends with Aimee, who is friends with Emery and Abdul. Emery is friends with Seth. So that's 5 steps. Hafsa is friends with Eyad, who is friends with Emery, who is friends with Seth. That's 4 steps. So yes, Hafsa is shorter.\n\nSo the shortest path is Prince -> Hafsa -> Eyad -> Emery -> Seth. So Prince should pass to Hafsa.\n</think>\n\nprince -> hafsa -> eyad -> emery -> seth\n\nhafsa"  correct=hafsa
