ey is friends with Miah.\n- Yosef is friends with Sasha.\n- Aubyrey is friends with Sanai.\n- Sanai is friends with AHBnaf.\n- Terrell is friends with Yosef.\n- Sadie is friends with Miah.\n- Stela is friends with Esteban.\n- Maxwell is friends with Isiah.\n- Terrell is friends with Donovan.\n- Stela is friends with Sadie.\n- Sanai is friends with Esteban.\n- Maxwell is friends with Isiah.\n\nNow, I need to map out the connections for each person. Let's focus on Maxwell and Stella since that's the main query.\n\nMaxwell is friends with Sadie. Sadie is friends with Stela, who is friends with Miah, who is friends with Aubyrey, who is friends with Stela. Wait, that seems a bit circular. Let me try to map it out properly.\n\nStarting with Maxwell:\n\n- Maxwell is directly connected to Sadie (distance 1).\n- Sadie is connected to Stela (distance 2).\n- Stela is connected to Miah (distance 3).\n- Miah is connected to Aubyrey (distance 4).\n- Aubyrey is connected to Stela (distance 5), but that's not helpful.\n\nAlternatively, from Maxwell, Sadie is at distance 1. Isiah is also a friend of Isiah, but Isiah is connected to Donovan, who is connected to Terrell, who is connected to Yosef, who is connected to Sasha, who is connected to Terrell, AHBnaf, and so on. But how does that connect to Stela?\n\nWait, let's see:\n\nIsiah is friends with Donovan (distance 1).\nDonovan is friends with Terrell (distance 2).\nTerrell is friends with Yosef (distance 3).\nYosef is friends with Sasha (distance 4).\nSasha is friends with AHBnaf (distance 5).\nAHBnaf is friends with Isiah (distance 6), which loops back.\n\nAlternatively, Sasha is friends with Terrell (distance 2) and Yosef (distance 3). But how does that help reach Stela?\n\nWait, Stela is friends with Miah (distance 1 from Stela). Miah is friends with Aubyrey (distance 2). Aubyrey is friends with Stela (distance 3), which is a loop.\n\nAlternatively, Miah is friends with Sadie (distance 2 from Stela). Sadie is friends with Maxwell (distance 3 from Stela). So, from Stela, the path to Maxwell is Stela -> Sadie -> Maxwell (distance 2).\n\nBut we need the path from Maxwell to Stela. So, Maxwell is friends with Sadie (distance 1). Sadie is friends with Stela (distance 2). So the shortest path is Maxwell -> Sadie -> Stela, which is 2 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Maxwell is friends with Isiah (since Isiah is friends with Donovan, who is friends with Terrell, who is friends with Yosef, who is friends with Sasha, who is friends with AHBnaf, who is friends with Isiah. So Isiah is connected to Maxwell? Wait, no. Maxwell is friends with Sadie, who is friends with Stela, who is friends with Miah, who is friends with Aubyrey, who is friends with Stela. So Isiah is not directly connected to Maxwell. Wait, Isiah is friends with Donovan, who is friends with Terrell, who is friends with Yosef, who is friends with Sasha, who is friends with AHBnaf, who is friends with Isiah. So Isiah is connected to Sasha (distance 1), Sasha is connected to Yosef (distance 2), Yosef to Terrell (distance 3), Terrell to Donovan (distance 4), Donovan to Isiah (distance 5). So Isiah is at distance 5 from Maxwell via this path.\n\nBut wait, Isiah is friends with AHBnaf, who is friends with Sasha, who is friends with Terrell, who is friends with Yosef, who is friends with Sasha. So Isiah is connected to Sasha (distance 1), Sasha to Yosef (distance 2), Yosef to Terrell (distance 3), Terrell to Donovan (distance 4), Donovan to Isiah (distance 5). So the path from Maxwell to Isiah would be through Sadie (distance 1), Sadie to Stela (distance 2), Stela to Miah (distance 3), Miah to Aubyrey (distance 4), Aubyrey to Stela (distance 5). That's a loop, so not helpful.\n\nAlternatively, from Maxwell to Sadie (distance 1), Sadie to Stela (distance 2). So the shortest path is 2 steps: Maxwell -> Sadie -> Stela.\n\nWait, but the question is whether Maxwell should pass the message to Sadie or Isiah first. So, from Maxwell, the direct friends are Sadie and Isiah. So the first step is either Sadie or Isiah.\n\nIf he passes to Sadie, then from Sadie, he can reach Stela in one more step (distance 2). If he passes to Isiah, then from Isiah, he needs to go through multiple steps to reach Stela, which would be longer.\n\nTherefore, the shortest path is through Sadie, making the path Maxwell -> Sadie -> Stela.\n\nSo the answer is sadie.\n</think>\n\nsadie -> stela sadie"  correct=sadie
