  [479/1150] '<think>\nAlright, let\'s tackle this problem step by step. So, the question is about determining whether Stella should pass the message to Sadie or Esteban to reach Maxwell the fastest. We need to use BFS for this.\n\nFirst, I\'ll map out all the friendships to visualize the graph. Let\'s list out the connections:\n\n- A: AUBREY is friends with STELLA, MIAH, and SANAI.\n- B: STELLA is friends with AUBREY, MIAH, TERRELL, and SASHA.\n- C: TERRELL is friends with STELLA, YOSEF, and DONOVAN.\n- D: DONOVAN is friends with ISHAH and TERRELL.\n- E: ISHAH is friends with DONOVAN and AHNAF.\n- F: SASHA is friends with TERRELL, YOSEF, and AHNAF.\n- G: YOSEF is friends with SASHA, STELLA, and TERRELL.\n- H: MAXWELL is friends with SADIE.\n- I: SADIE is friends with AUBREY, MAXWELL, and MIAH.\n- J: MIAH is friends with AUBREY, STELLA, and SADIE.\n- K: SANAI is friends with AUBREY and ESTEBAN.\n- L: ESTEBAN is friends with SANAI and STERR... Wait, no, looking back, it\'s written as "esteban is friends with stella." So, L: ESTEBAN is friends with STELLA and SANAI.\n\nNow, we need to find the shortest path from Stella to Maxwell. Let\'s start BFS from Stella.\n\nLevel 0: Stella (distance 0)\nNeighbors of Stella: AUBREY, MIAH, TERRELL, SASHA (distance 1)\n\nCheck each of these to see if any is connected to Maxwell.\n\nLooking at each:\n- AUBREY: friends with Stella, MIAH, SANAI. Not connected to Maxwell.\n- MIAH: friends with AUBREY, Stella, SADIE. Not connected to Maxwell.\n- TERRELL: friends with Stella, YOSEF, DONOVAN. YOSEF is connected to SASHA and STELLA, but not directly to Maxwell. DONOVAN is connected to ISHAH and TERRELL, but not to Maxwell.\n- SASHA: friends with TERRELL, YOSEF, AHNAF. YOSEF is connected to SASHA and others, but not to Maxwell.\n\nSo, none of the direct friends of Stella are connected to Maxwell. We move to level 1.\n\nLevel 1: AUBREY, MIAH, TERRELL, SASHA (distance 1)\n\nNow, check their friends:\n\n- AUBREY\'s friends: MIAH, SANAI. MIAH is already in level 1. SANAI is new (distance 2). SANAI is friends with AUBREY and ESTEBAN. So, ESTEBAN is added to level 2.\n- MIAH\'s friends: AUBREY, Stella, SADIE. SADIE is new (distance 2). SADIE is friends with AUBREY, MAXWELL, and MIAH. So, MAXWELL is added to level 2.\n- TERRELL\'s friends: Stella, YOSEF, DONOVAN. YOSEF is new (distance 2). YOSEF is friends with SASHA, STELLA, and TERRELL. Don\'t add anything new.\n- SASHA\'s friends: TERRELL, YOSEF, AHNAF. YOSEF is new (distance 2). AHNAF is new (distance 2). AHNAF is friends with ISHAH and SASHA. So, ISHAH is added to level 2.\n\nSo, at level 2, we have SANAI, SADIE, YOSEF, AHNAF.\n\nNow, check if any of these are connected to Maxwell. SADIE is connected to MAXWELL, so we\'ve found a path through SADIE.\n\nSo, the path is Stella -> SADIE -> MAXWELL. That\'s two steps.\n\nAlternatively, let\'s see if there\'s a shorter path through another route. From level 1, we also have YOSEF and AHNAF, but they don\'t connect to Maxwell directly. So, the shortest path is through SADIE.\n\nTherefore, Stella should pass the message to Sadie first.\n</think>\n\nsadie'  correct=sadie
