h path.\n\nFirst, if Isiah passes the message to Donovan:\n\n- Isiah -> Donovan. Now, Donovan is friends with Terrell and Yosef. So, from Donovan, we can go to Terrell or Yosef.\n\n- If we go to Terrell, he's friends with Sasha and Yosef. So, from Terrell, we can reach Sasha directly. That would be Isiah -> Donovan -> Terrell -> Sasha. That's three steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Donovan, if we go to Yosef, Yosef is friends with Sasha and Terrell. So, Yosef -> Sasha is one step. So, Isiah -> Donovan -> Yosef -> Sasha. That's also three steps.\n\nNow, if Isiah passes the message to Ahnaf:\n\n- Isiah -> Ahnaf. Ahnaf is friends with Isiah and Sasha. So, from Ahnaf, we can go directly to Sasha. That's Isiah -> Ahnaf -> Sasha. That's two steps.\n\nWait, that seems shorter. So, the path through Ahnaf is two steps, while through Donovan is three steps. Therefore, Isiah should pass the message to Ahnaf to reach Sasha faster.\n\nI think that's the correct approach. So, the shortest path is Isiah -> Ahnaf -> Sasha.\n</think>\n\nisiah -> ahnaf -> sasha ahnaf"  correct=ahnaf
