 friends with Sasha and Terrell. So, from Yosef, we can\'t reach Isiah directly. Therefore, the path through Terrell would require going through someone else, but I don\'t see a direct connection from Yosef to Isiah. So, the path through Terrell would be longer.\n\nTherefore, the shortest path is Sasha -> Ahnaf -> Isiah, which is two steps. So, Sasha should pass the message to Ahnaf first.\n</think>\n\nThe shortest path from Sasha to Isiah is Sasha -> Ahnaf -> Isiah. Therefore, the correct option is "ahnaf".\n\nahnaf'  correct=ahnaf
