nnected to Sadie directly, so Miah -> Sadie is one step, and Sadie is connected to Isiah, so total two steps. Alternatively, Miah -> Aubrey, and Aubrey is connected to Sadie, so Miah -> Aubrey -> Sadie -> Isiah, which is three steps. So the direct path through Sadie is shorter.\n\nWait, but the question is whether Miah should pass the message to Aubrey or Sadie first. So, the first step is either to Aubrey or Sadie. Since the direct friend Isiah is connected to Sadie, Miah can reach Isiah in two steps via Sadie. Alternatively, via Aubrey, it's three steps. So the shortest path is through Sadie.\n\nTherefore, Miah should pass the message to Sadie first.\n</think>\n\nThe shortest path from Miah to Isiah is Miah -> Sadie -> Isiah. Therefore, Miah should begin by passing the message to Sadie.\n\nsadie"  correct=sadie
