  [539/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Donovan should pass the message to Terrell or Isiah to reach Sadie the fastest. I remember that BFS is used for finding the shortest path in an unweighted graph, so I'll apply that here.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the friends and their connections. Let's list out the friends of each person:\n\n- Donovan is friends with Isiah and Terrell.\n- Isiah is friends with Donovan, Maxwell, and Ahnaf.\n- Terrell is friends with Donovan, Sadie, Yosef, and Sasha.\n- Sadie is friends with Maxwell, Donovan, and Miah.\n- Miah is friends with Sadie, AHBernard, and StellA.\n- StellA is friends with AUBrey, Miah, and Esteban.\n- AUBrey is friends with Miah, Sadie, and Sanai.\n- Sanai is friends with AUBrey and Esteban.\n- Esteban is friends with Sanai and StellA.\n- Yosef is friends with Terrell and Sasha.\n- Sasha is friends with Terrell, Yosef, and Ahnaf.\n- Ahnaf is friends with Sasha and Isiah.\n- Maxwell is friends with Sadie and Isiah.\n\nNow, starting from Donovan, I'll perform BFS to find the shortest path to Sadie.\n\nLevel 0: Donovan\n- Neighbors: Isiah, Terrell\n\nLevel 1: Isiah, Terrell\n- Isiah's friends: Maxwell, Ahnaf, Donovan (already visited)\n- Terrell's friends: Sadie, Yosef, Sasha, Donovan (Donovan already visited)\n\nCheck if Sadie is reached at Level 1. Yes, through Terrell. So the shortest path is Donovan -> Terrell -> Sadie.\n\nWait, but let me double-check. Is there a shorter path through Isiah? Isiah is at Level 1, but he's not connected to Sadie directly. Sadie is connected to Maxwell and Miah, who are at Level 2. So no, the shortest path is through Terrell.\n\nSo Donovan should pass the message to Terrell first.\n</think>\n\ndonovan -> terrell -> sadie terrell"  correct=isiah
