ef, we get Sash, Terrell.\n\nEsteban\'s friends: Sash, Sanai. So from Esteban, we get Sash, Sanai.\n\nNow, check if any of these are Ahnaf. From Yosef, we get Sash. From Sash, we can reach Isiah and Ahnaf.\n\nWait, let\'s see:\n\nAt Level 2, the nodes are Sadie, Sanai, Stella, Maxwell, Isiah, Sash, Terrell, Sanai.\n\nWait, but we need to track visited nodes to avoid cycles.\n\nSo, starting from Miah, Level 0: Miah.\n\nLevel 1: Auby, Sadie, Yosef, Esteban.\n\nLevel 2: From Auby: Sadie (already visited), Sanai, Stella.\n\nFrom Sadie: Maxwell, Isiah.\n\nFrom Yosef: Sash, Terrell.\n\nFrom Esteban: Sash, Sanai.\n\nSo, at Level 2, the new nodes are Sanai, Stella, Maxwell, Isiah, Sash, Terrell.\n\nNow, check if any of these are Ahnaf. No.\n\nLevel 3: From each of these new nodes:\n\nFrom Sanai: Auby, Esteban, Sadie (all visited), and maybe others? Wait, Sanai\'s friends are Auby, Esteban, Sadie, and maybe others? From the data: "sanai is friends with aubrey. esteban is friends with sanai." So Sanai\'s friends are Auby, Esteban, Sadie.\n\nFrom Stella: Auby, Miah, Sadie, Terrell. All except Terrell are visited.\n\nFrom Maxwell: Sadie, Isiah. Both visited.\n\nFrom Isiah: Maxwell, Sash, Ahnaf. So Isiah is connected to Ahnaf.\n\nSo, from Isiah, we reach Ahnaf.\n\nTherefore, the path is Miah -> Isiah -> Ahnaf.\n\nBut wait, let\'s see the BFS steps:\n\nLevel 0: Miah.\n\nLevel 1: Auby, Sadie, Yosef, Esteban.\n\nLevel 2: From Auby: Sadie (visited), Sanai, Stella.\n\nFrom Sadie: Maxwell, Isiah.\n\nFrom Yosef: Sash, Terrell.\n\nFrom Esteban: Sash, Sanai.\n\nSo, Level 2 nodes: Sanai, Stella, Maxwell, Isiah, Sash, Terrell.\n\nCheck if any are Ahnaf. No.\n\nLevel 3: From each of these:\n\nFrom Sanai: Auby, Esteban, Sadie (all visited).\n\nFrom Stella: Auby, Miah, Sadie, Terrell (all visited except Terrell, but we already have Terrell in Level 2).\n\nFrom Maxwell: Sadie, Isiah (Isiah is in Level 2).\n\nFrom Isiah: Sash, Ahnaf. So Ahnaf is found at Level 3.\n\nSo the shortest path is Miah