sare -> Eunice -> Alyssa -> cesar -> derek? Wait, no, because from Eunice, you can go to Alyssa, who is connected to Derek. So, that's three steps: Cesare -> Eunice -> Alyssa -> Derek.\n\nSo, the shortest path is through Legend, which is two steps. Therefore, Cesare should pass the message to Legend first.\n</think>\n\nlegend -> derek\n\nlegend"  correct=alyssa
