rter path. Since cesar is directly connected to alyssa, and alyssa is directly connected to derek, that's the shortest path with two steps.\n\nAlternatively, if I look at eunice, she's connected to cesar, but not directly to derek. So the path through eunice would be longer.\n\nTherefore, the shortest path is cesar -> alyssa -> derek. So cesar should pass the message to alyssa first.\n</think>\n\ncesar -> alyssa -> derek alyssa"  correct=alyssa
