  [764/1150] "<think>\nAlright, let's tackle this problem step by step. So, the question is about determining the shortest path for Mackenzie to pass a message to Abdul using the given friendship graph. The options are whether Mackenzie should pass the message to Jaliyah or Derek first.\n\nFirst, I need to visualize the graph based on the provided friendships. Let me list out all the connections:\n\n- Jorge is friends with Jonathon and Lucy.\n- Jonathon is friends with Jorge and Preston.\n- Preston is friends with Jonathon and Lucy.\n- Lucy is friends with Preston, Jorge, and Abdi.\n- Abdi is friends with Lucy, Jaliyah, and Abdul.\n- Jaliyah is friends with Abdi, Makenzie, and Bruno.\n- Bruno is friends with Jaliyah, Luc, and Abdi.\n- Makenzie is friends with Mackenzie, Legend, and Abdi.\n- Legend is friends with Mackenzie, Cesar, and Makenzie.\n- Cesar is friends with Legend, Eunice, and Alyssa.\n- Eunice is friends with Makenzie, Alyssa, and Cesar.\n- Alyssa is friends with Eunice, Makenzie, and Derek.\n- Derek is friends with Alyssa, Abdi, and Makenzie.\n\nWait, I think I might have mixed up some names. Let me correct that. The correct list should be:\n\n- Jorge: Jonathon, Lucy\n- Jonathon: Jorge, Preston\n- Preston: Jonathon, Lucy\n- Lucy: Preston, Jorge, Abdi\n- Abdi: Lucy, Jaliyah, Abdul\n- Jaliyah: Abdi, Makenzie, Bruno\n- Bruno: Jaliyah, Luc, Abdi\n- Makenzie: Mackenzie, Legend, Abdi\n- Legend: Mackenzie, Cesar, Makenzie\n- Cesar: Legend, Eunice, Alyssa\n- Eunice: Makenzie, Alyssa, Cesar\n- Alyssa: Eunice, Makenzie, Derek\n- Derek: Alyssa, Abdi, Makenzie\n\nNow, Mackenzie wants to pass a message to Abdul. So, the starting point is Makenzie, and the target is Abdul.\n\nI'll perform a BFS starting from Makenzie.\n\nLevel 0: Makenzie\n\nNeighbors of Makenzie: Mackenzie (herself, ignore), Legend, Abdi.\n\nSo, first step: Legend and Abdi.\n\nLevel 1: Legend, Abdi\n\nNow, explore neighbors of Legend: Mackenzie (visited), Cesar, Makenzie (visited). So, Cesar is added.\n\nExplore neighbors of Abdi: Lucy, Jaliyah, Makenzie (visited). So, Lucy and Jaliyah are added.\n\nLevel 2: Cesar, Lucy, Jaliyah\n\nNow, explore neighbors of Cesar: Legend (visited), Eunice, Alyssa.\n\nNeighbors of Lucy: Preston, Jorge, Abdi (visited). So, Preston and Jorge are added.\n\nNeighbors of Jaliyah: Abdi (visited), Makenzie (visited), Bruno.\n\nLevel 3: Eunice, Alyssa, Preston, Jorge, Bruno\n\nNow, explore Eunice's neighbors: Makenzie (visited), Alyssa, Cesar (visited). So, Alyssa is added.\n\nAlyssa's neighbors: Eunice (visited), Makenzie (visited), Derek.\n\nPreston's neighbors: Jonathon, Lucy (visited). Jonathon is added.\n\nJorge's neighbors: Jonathon, Lucy (visited). Jonathon is added.\n\nBruno's neighbors: Jaliyah (visited), Luc, Abdi (visited). So, Luc is added.\n\nLevel 4: Alyssa, Jonathon, Derek, Luc\n\nNow, explore Alyssa's neighbors: Derek is added.\n\nDerek's neighbors: Alyssa (visited), Abdi (visited), Makenzie (visited). So, no new nodes.\n\nSo, the shortest path from Makenzie to Abdul is through Abdi. The path is Makenzie -> Abdi -> Abdul.\n\nWait, but the options are whether to go to Jaliyah or Derek first. So, in the BFS, the first step from Makenzie is to Legend or Abdi. Since Abdi is one of the options, and the path through Abdi leads directly to Abdul, that's the shortest path.\n\nTherefore, Makenzie should pass the message to Abdi (Derek) first.\n</think>\n\nmackenzie -> abdi -> abdul\n\nabdul"  correct=jaliyah
