  [769/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Legend should pass the message to Mackenzie or Cesar to reach Bruno the fastest. I remember that BFS is used for finding the shortest path in an unweighted graph, so I'll apply that here.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the connections. Legend is friends with Mackenzie and Cesar. So from Legend, the first step is to Mackenzie and Cesar. Now, I need to see where Mackenzie and Cesar are connected.\n\nLooking at Mackenzie, they're friends with Jaliyah, Jaliyah is friends with Bruno. So from Legend to Mackenzie to Jaliyah to Bruno. That's a path of length 3.\n\nNow, Cesar is friends with Eunice and Legend. Eunice is friends with Alyssa and cesar. Alyssa is friends with Eunice, Jorge, and Derek. Jorge is friends with Jonathon and Lucy. Lucy is friends with Preston, Abdi, and Bruno. So from Cesar, we go to Eunice, then to Alyssa, then to Jorge, then to Lucy, then to Bruno. That's a path of length 5.\n\nComparing the two paths: Mackenzie leads to Bruno in 3 steps, while Cesar takes 5 steps. So the shortest path is through Mackenzie.\n</think>\n\nmackenzie -> jaliyah -> bruno\nmackenzie"  correct=mackenzie
