onnected to Jaliyah, who is connected to Bruno. So that's two steps. From Alyssa, the path is longer. So the shortest path is Mackenzie.\n\nTherefore, Derek should pass the message to Mackenzie first.\n</think>\n\nmackenzie->jaliyah->bruno\n\nmackenzie"  correct=mackenzie
