  [778/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Bruno should pass the message to Jaliyah or Lucy first to get to Cesar the fastest. I remember that BFS is used for finding the shortest path in an unweighted graph, so that's the method I should use here.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the friendships to visualize the graph. Let me list out the connections:\n\n- Bruno is friends with Jaliyah, Luc, and Ab.\n- Luc is friends with Pre, Jon, Jor, and Ab.\n- Jor is friends with Jon, Luc, and Ab.\n- Jon is friends with Jor and Pre.\n- Pre is friends with Jon, Luc, and Ce.\n- Ce is friends with Pre, Eun, and Luc.\n- Eun is friends with Aly, and also connected to Brn.\n- Aly is friends with Eun, Luc, and Der.\n- Der is friends with Aly, Brn, and Mac.\n- Mac is friends with Mck, Luc, and Der.\n- Mck is friends with Mac, Legend, and Brn.\n- Legend is friends with Mac, Ce, and Mck.\n- Brn is connected to Jali, Luc, and Ab.\n- Jali is connected to Bruno, Mck, and Ab.\n- Ab is connected to Bruno, Jali, Luc, and Der.\n- Luc is also connected to Pre, Jon, Jor, and Ab.\n- Pre is connected to Jon, Luc, and Ce.\n- Ce is connected to Pre, Eun, and Luc.\n- Eun is connected to Aly, Brn, and Brn.\n- Aly is connected to Eun, Luc, and Der.\n- Der is connected to Aly, Brn, and Mac.\n- Mac is connected to Mck, Luc, and Der.\n- Mck is connected to Mac, Legend, and Brn.\n- Legend is connected to Mac, Ce, and Mck.\n- Brn is also connected to Jor, Luc, and Ab.\n\nWait, that's a bit confusing. Maybe I should draw it step by step.\n\nStarting from Bruno, the first layer is Jali, Luc, and Ab.\n\nFrom Jali, the next layer would be her friends: Mck, Ab, and Jali is connected to Bruno, so we've already covered Bruno. So Mck and Ab are in the next layer.\n\nFrom Luc, his friends are Pre, Jon, Jor, and Ab. So Pre, Jon, Jor, and Ab are in the next layer.\n\nFrom Ab, friends are Bruno (already visited), Jali (already visited), Luc (already visited), and Der. So Der is added to the next layer.\n\nNow