Pinchas, which is three steps. Alternatively, if Binyomin passes to Red, then Red would have to go through Yaakov and others, which is longer.\n\nTherefore, Binyomin should pass the message to Trinary first.\n</think>\n\nreed trinity\n\nreed"  correct=trinity
