o we need to look one step further.\n\nLet's explore each of these:\n\n1. From Pincha: Pincha is connected to Cataleya and Yaakov. No new nodes here.\n2. From Red: Red is connected to Yaakov, Sulaiman, and Binyomin. So, from Red, we can go to Sulaiman and Binyomin.\n3. From Binyomin: Binyomin is connected to Yaakov and Trin. So, from Binyomin, we can go to Trin.\n\nNow, let's see if any of these new nodes (Sulaiman and Trin) are connected to Dallas.\n\nLooking at Sulaiman's friends: Sulaiman is connected to Yaakov, Red, and Sydney. No direct connection to Dallas.\n\nTrin's friends: Trin is connected to Miah, Keith, and Binyomin. No direct connection to Dallas.\n\nSo, from the second step, we haven't reached Dallas yet. Let's go one step further.\n\nFrom Sulaiman: Sulaiman is connected to Yaakov, Red, and Sydney. So, from Sulaiman, we can go to Sydney.\n\nFrom Trin: Trin is connected to Miah, Keith, and Binyomin. So, from Trin, we can go to Miah, Keith, or Binyomin.\n\nNow, let's check if any of these new nodes (Sydney, Miah, Keith, Binyomin) are connected to Dallas.\n\nSydney's friends: Sydney is connected to Sulaiman, Keith, and Red. No direct connection to Dallas.\n\nMiah's friends: Miah is connected to Cataleya, Wolf, and Dallas. Oh, here we go! Miah is directly connected to Dallas.\n\nSo, the path from Yaakov to Dallas would be:\n\nYaakov -> Red -> Miah -> Dallas\n\nBut wait, let's check if there's a shorter path through Binyomin.\n\nFrom Binyomin, we went to Trin, then to Keith, then to Miah, and then to Dallas. That would be a longer path.\n\nAlternatively, from Binyomin, can we reach Dallas directly? No, Binyomin is only connected to Yaakov and Trin.\n\nSo, the shortest path is Yaakov -> Red -> Miah -> Dallas.\n\nBut wait, the options are whether Yaakov should pass the message to Sulaiman or Binyomin first. So, the first step is either Sulaiman or Binyomin.\n\nFrom Yaakov, the direct friends are Pincha, Red, and Binyomin. So, the first step is to choose betwe