s connected to wolf, who is connected to cataleya, who is connected to fiona, who is connected to pinchas, who is connected to miah. That\'s a longer path.\n\nWait, maybe I\'m missing a direct connection. Let me check the connections again. Oh, wait, miah is friends with dallas, who is friends with wolf, who is friends with cataleya, who is friends with fiona, who is friends with pinchas, who is friends with cataleya. That\'s a loop. Alternatively, miah is friends with dallas, who is friends with wolf, who is friends with fiona, who is friends with cataleya, who is friends with pinchas, who is friends with miah. That\'s a cycle, so not helpful.\n\nWait, maybe I should look at the connections again. From sulaiman, friends are reed and yaakov. From reed, friends are yaakov and sulaiman. From yaakov, friends are reed, sulaiman, binyomin, keith, sydney. From sydney, friends are keith and sulaiman. From keith, friends are yaakov and sydney. So, the shortest path from sulaiman to miah would be through yaakov to keith to sydney? Wait, no, because miah isn\'t connected to sydney. Wait, miah is connected to dallas, who is connected to wolf, who is connected to cataleya, who is connected to fiona, who is connected to pinchas, who is connected to miah. That\'s a longer path.\n\nWait, maybe I\'m overcomplicating. Let me try to map it out step by step.\n\nBFS from sulaiman:\n\nLevel 0: sulaiman\n\nLevel 1: reed, yaakov\n\nLevel 2: from reed: none new; from yaakov: binyomin, keith, sydney\n\nLevel 3: from binyomin: none new; from keith: none new; from sydney: none new\n\nWait, but miah isn\'t in this path. So, maybe I\'m missing something. Oh, wait, miah is connected to dallas, who is connected to wolf, who is connected to cataleya, who is connected to fiona, who is connected to pinchas, who is connected to miah. That\'s a separate branch. So, the shortest path from sulaiman to miah would be through the other friends.\n\nWait, maybe I\'m not considering all connections. Let me li