  [923/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Magaly should pass the message to Kendra or Esmeralda to get to Joziah the fastest. I remember that BFS is used for finding the shortest path in an unweighted graph, so I'll use that approach.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the friendships to build the graph. Let me list out all the connections:\n\n- Joziah is friends with Kendra.\n- Kendra is friends with Joziah, Esteban, and Magaly.\n- Esteban is friends with Kendra and Sima.\n- Sima is friends with Esteban, Malak, and Malcom.\n- Malcom is friends with Sima, Franscua, and Joziah.\n- Franscua is friends with Malcom and Magaly.\n- Magaly is friends with Kendra, Malcom, and Esmeralda.\n- Esmeralda is friends with Magaly, Quin, and Ayden.\n- Quin is friends with Esmeralda, Malak, and Esteban.\n- Malak is friends with Quin, Ayden, and Sima.\n- Ayden is friends with Quin, Esmeralda, and Malak.\n- Camero is friends with Isiah and Malak.\n- Isiah is friends with Ayden and Camero.\n\nNow, starting from Magaly, I'll perform BFS to find the shortest path to Joziah.\n\nLevel 0: Magaly\n\nFrom Magaly, friends are Kendra and Esmeralda.\n\nLevel 1: Kendra, Esmeralda\n\nCheck if either is Joziah. No.\n\nFrom Kendra, friends are Joziah, Esteban, and Magaly. Magaly is already visited, so Joziah is at distance 1 from Kendra.\n\nFrom Esmeralda, friends are Magaly, Quin, and Ayden. Magaly is already visited, so we add Quin and Ayden to level 2.\n\nSo, the shortest path from Magaly to Joziah is through Kendra, which is one step away. Therefore, Magaly should pass the message to Kendra first.\n</think>\n\nkendra joziah  \nkendra"  correct=kendra
