. Isiah is connected to CameroN (step 4). CameroN is connected to Sima (step 5). Sima is connected to Esteban (step 6). So that\'s 6 steps.\n\nWait, but earlier I thought the path through QuinN -> Ayden -> Isiah -> CameroN -> Sima -> Esteban is 5 steps. Let me count:\n\n1. Magaly -> QuinN\n\n2. QuinN -> Ayden\n\n3. Ayden -> Isiah\n\n4. Isiah -> CameroN\n\n5. CameroN -> Sima\n\n6. Sima -> Esteban\n\nWait, that\'s 6 steps. But maybe there\'s a shorter path.\n\nAlternatively, from Magaly -> QuinN -> Malak (step 2). Malak is connected to Ayden (step 3). Ayden is connected to Esmeralda (step 4). Esmeralda is connected to QuinN (step 5), which loops back. Alternatively, from Ayden, go to Isiah (step 4). Isiah is connected to CameroN (step 5). CameroN is connected to Sima (step 6). Sima is connected to Esteban (step 7). So that\'s 7 steps.\n\nWait, maybe I\'m missing a shorter path. Let me try BFS starting from Magaly and Esteban.\n\nMagaly is at level 0.\n\nLevel 1: QuinN, Esmeralda.\n\nFrom QuinN (level 1), connected to Ayden, Malak.\n\nFrom Esmeralda (level 1), connected to QuinN, Ayden.\n\nLevel 2: Ayden, Malak.\n\nFrom Ayden (level 2), connected to Esmeralda, Isiah.\n\nFrom Malak (level 2), connected to QuinN, Ayden.\n\nLevel 3: Isiah.\n\nFrom Isiah (level 3), connected to CameroN, Ayden.\n\nLevel 4: CameroN.\n\nFrom CameroN (level 4), connected to Sima, Malak.\n\nLevel 5: Sima.\n\nFrom Sima (level 5), connected to Esteban.\n\nSo the shortest path is Magaly -> QuinN -> Ayden -> Isiah -> CameroN -> Sima -> Esteban, which is 6 steps.\n\nWait, but earlier I thought it was 5 steps. Maybe I\'m miscounting.\n\nWait, let me list the path:\n\n1. Magaly -> QuinN\n\n2. QuinN -> Ayden\n\n3. Ayden -> Isiah\n\n4. Isiah -> CameroN\n\n5. CameroN -> Sima\n\n6. Sima -> Esteban\n\nSo that\'s 6 steps. But maybe there\'s a shorter path through Esmeralda.\n\nFrom Magaly -> Esmeralda (step 1). Esmeralda is connected to QuinN (step 2). QuinN is connected to Ayden (step 3). Ayden is connecte