aly. Since the shortest path is through Magaly, the answer is Magaly.\n\nWait, but in BFS, the shortest path is determined by the number of edges. So from Kendra, the distance to Esmeralda is 3 steps via Magaly, whereas via Joziah is 4 steps. So the shortest path is through Magaly.\n\nTherefore, the correct option is Magaly.\n</think>\n\nkendra is friends with joziah and magaly. to reach esmeralda, the shortest path is through magaly: kendra -> magaly -> quin -> esmeralda. this is a 3-step path, whereas through joziah it would be 4 steps. so kendra should pass the message to magaly.\n\nmagaly'  correct=magaly
