  [970/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Sima should pass the message to Francesca or Esteban to get to Kendra the fastest. I remember that BFS is used for finding the shortest path in an unweighted graph, so I'll apply that here.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the friendships to build the graph. Let me list out all the connections:\n\n- Jozyiah is friends with Kendra.\n- Ayden is friends with Esmeralda and Isiah.\n- Franscua is friends with Sima.\n- Malak is friends with Cameron.\n- Magaly is friends with Esmeralda.\n- Quin is friends with Malak and Esteban.\n- Esteban is friends with Sima and Kendra.\n- Sima is friends with Franscua and Malak.\n- Camero is friends with Isiah and Malak.\n- Isiah is friends with Ayden and Camero.\n- Magaly is also friends with Kendra.\n- Quin is friends with Ayden and Malak.\n- Esmeralda is friends with Quin and Magaly.\n- Franscua is friends with Malc and Jozyiah.\n- Kenda is friends with Jozyiah, Magaly, and Esteban.\n- Esteban is friends with Kenda and Sima.\n- Sima is friends with Franscua and Malak.\n- Malak is friends with Quin, Camero, and Ayden.\n- Quin is friends with Ayden and Malak.\n- Ayden is friends with Quin, Esmeralda, and Malak.\n- Esmeralda is friends with Quin and Magaly.\n- Camero is friends with Isiah and Malak.\n- Isiah is friends with Ayden and Camero.\n\nNow, starting from Sima, I'll perform BFS to find the shortest path to Kendra.\n\nLevel 0: Sima\nNeighbors of Sima: Franscua, Malak\n\nLevel 1: Franscua, Malak\n\nCheck if any of these are Kendra. No.\n\nNow, explore their neighbors.\n\nFrom Franscua:\nNeighbors: Jozyiah, Kenda, Magaly\n\nFrom Malak:\nNeighbors: Quin, Camero, Isiah\n\nSo Level 2: Jozyiah, Kenda, Magaly, Quin, Camero, Isiah\n\nCheck if any are Kendra. Yes, Kenda is here.\n\nSo the shortest path is Sima -> Malak -> Camero -> Isiah -> Ayden -> Quin -> Kenda? Wait, no, that's too long. Wait, no, from Malak, we go to Quin, Camero, Isiah. So from Malak, the next step is to check if any of these are Kenda. No. So Level 2 nodes are Jozyiah, Kenda, Magaly, Quin, Camero, Isiah.\n\nWait, Kenda is directly connected to Jozyiah, Magaly, and Esteban. So from Sima, the path to Kenda could be through Malak to Camero to Isiah to Ayden to Quin to Kenda, but that's 5 steps. Alternatively, through Malak to Quin to Ayden to Quin? Wait, no, that's a loop. Alternatively, from Sima to Malak to Isiah to Camero to Kenda? Wait, no, Kenda is directly connected to Isiah? No, Kenda is connected to Jozyiah, Magaly, and Esteban. So from Malak, we go to Quin, Camero, Isiah. Isiah is connected to Ayden and Camero. So from Isiah, we can go to Ayden, but Ayden is connected to Quin and Malak. So from Isiah, we can go to Camero, but Camero is connected to Kenda. So the path would be Sima -> Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda. That's 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Sima to Malak to Quin to Ayden to Quin? No, that's a loop. Alternatively, from Sima to Malak to Quin to Esmeralda to Magaly to Kenda. That's 5 steps.\n\nWait, but from Sima, the direct neighbors are Franscua and Malak. So the shortest path would be through Malak. From Malak, we go to Quin, Camero, Isiah. From Isiah, we go to Camero and Ayden. From Camero, we go to Kenda. So the path is Sima -> Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda. That's 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Sima to Malak to Quin to Ayden to Quin? No, that's a loop. Alternatively, from Sima to Malak to Quin to Esmeralda to Magaly to Kenda. That's 5 steps, which is longer.\n\nSo the shortest path is Sima -> Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda.\n\nWait, but from Malak, we can also go to Quin, who is connected to Ayden and Esmeralda. From Quin, we can go to Esmeralda, who is connected to Magaly and Kenda. So from Sima to Malak to Quin to Esmeralda to Magaly to Kenda. That's 5 steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is 4 steps: Sima -> Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda.\n\nWait, but from Malak, we can go to Isiah, who is connected to Camero, who is connected to Kenda. So that's 3 steps from Malak to Kenda: Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda. So the path is Sima -> Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda.\n\nAlternatively, from Malak, we can go to Quin, who is connected to Ayden, who is connected to Quin again (loop), or to Esmeralda, who is connected to Magaly, who is connected to Kenda. So that's 5 steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is 4 steps, going through Malak, Isiah, Camero.\n\nWait, but from Sima to Malak to Isiah to Camero to Kenda is 4 steps. Alternatively, from Sima to Malak to Quin to Esmeralda to Magaly to Kenda is 5 steps. So the shortest is 4 steps.\n\nBut wait, from Sima to Malak to Isiah to Camero to Kenda is 4 steps. Alternatively, from Sima to Malak to Quin to Ayden to Quin? No, that's a loop. Alternatively, from Sima to Malak to Quin to Esmeralda to Magaly to Kenda is 5 steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is 4 steps: Sima -> Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda.\n\nWait, but from Malak, we can go to Isiah, who is connected to Camero, who is connected to Kenda. So that's 3 steps from Malak to Kenda. So the path is Sima -> Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda.\n\nAlternatively, from Malak, we can go to Quin, who is connected to Esmeralda, who is connected to Magaly, who is connected to Kenda. That's 4 steps from Malak to Kenda: Malak -> Quin -> Esmeralda -> Magaly -> Kenda. So the path would be Sima -> Malak -> Quin -> Esmeralda -> Magaly -> Kenda, which is 5 steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is 4 steps: Sima -> Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda.\n\nWait, but from Malak, we can go to Isiah, who is connected to Camero, who is connected to Kenda. So that's 3 steps from Malak to Kenda. So the path is Sima -> Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda.\n\nAlternatively, from Malak, we can go to Quin, who is connected to Ayden, who is connected to Quin (loop), or to Esmeralda, who is connected to Magaly, who is connected to Kenda. So that's 4 steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is 4 steps: Sima -> Malak -> Isiah -> Camero -> Kenda.\n\nWait, but from Malak, we c