  [973/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Francesca should pass the message to Malcolm or Sima first to get to Joziah the quickest. I remember that BFS is used for finding the shortest path in an unweighted graph, so I'll apply that here.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the friendships to build the graph. Let me list out all the connections:\n\n- Joziah is friends with Kendra.\n- Kendra is friends with Joziah, Esteban, and Magaly.\n- Esteban is friends with Kendra and Sima.\n- Sima is friends with Esteban, Malak, and Franscua (I think that's a typo, probably Francesca).\n- Francesca is friends with Malc (another typo, should be Malcolm) and Magaly.\n- Magaly is friends with Kendra and Francesca.\n- Quin is friends with Esmeralda, Malak, and others, but I don't think she's relevant here.\n- Esmeralda is friends with Quin and others, but again, maybe not needed.\n- Ayden is friends with Esmeralda, Isiah, and Quin.\n- Isiah is friends with Ayden and Cam.\n- Cam is friends with Isiah and Sima.\n- Sima is connected to Esteban, Malak, and Franscua (Francesca).\n- Malak is friends with Quin, Ayden, and Cam.\n- Quin is friends with Esmeralda, Malak, and others.\n- Esmeralda is friends with Quin and others.\n- Magaly is friends with K and F.\n- K is friends with J, E, M.\n- E is friends with K, S.\n- S is friends with E, M, F.\n- M is friends with S, C, A, Q.\n- A is friends with E, Q, M.\n- C is friends with M, I.\n- I is friends with A.\n- Q is friends with E, M, A, K.\n- F is friends with M, C.\n\nWait, I think I might have mixed up some names. Let me correct that.\n\nLooking back, the connections are:\n\n- Joziah (J) is friends with K.\n- K is friends with J, E, M.\n- E is friends with K, S.\n- S is friends with E, M, F.\n- M is friends with S, C, A, Q.\n- A is friends with E, Q, M.\n- C is friends with M, I.\n- I is friends with A.\n- Q is friends with E, M, A, K.\n- F is friends with M, C.\n- Q is also friends with A and K.\n- S is friends with E, M, F.\n-