  [980/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Esmeralda should pass the message to Ayden or Magaly to get to Cameron the fastest. I remember that BFS is used for finding the shortest path in an unweighted graph, so I'll apply that here.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the friendships to build the graph. Let me list out all the connections:\n\n- Joziah is friends with Kendra.\n- Kendra is friends with Joziah, Malcom, and Magaly.\n- Magaly is friends with Kendra and Esmeralda.\n- Esmeralda is friends with Magaly, Quin, and Ayden.\n- Quin is friends with Esmeralda, Malak, and Esteban.\n- Malak is friends with Quin, Sima, and Ayden.\n- Sima is friends with Malak, Esteban, and Fransc.\n- Fransc is friends with Sima and Malcolm.\n- Malcolm is friends with Fransc, Cam, and Joziah.\n- Cam is friends with Malcolm and Isiah.\n- Isiah is friends with Cam and Ayden.\n- Ayden is friends with Isiah, Quin, Esmeralda, and Malak.\n- Malcom is friends with Joziah, Fransc, and Cam.\n- Esteban is friends with Sima and Kendra.\n- Sima is friends with Malak, Esteban, and Fransc.\n- Cam is friends with Malcolm and Isiah.\n- Isiah is friends with Cam and Ayden.\n- Quin is friends with Esmeralda, Malak, and Esteban.\n- Malak is friends with Quin, Sima, and Ayden.\n- Esmeralda is friends with Quin, Magaly, and Ayden.\n- Cam is friends with Malcolm and Isiah.\n- Isiah is friends with Cam and Ayden.\n- Magaly is friends with Kendra and Esmeralda.\n- Joziah is friends with Kendra and Malcom.\n- Kendra is friends with Joziah and Magaly.\n\nNow, starting from Esmeralda, I'll perform BFS to find the shortest path to Cameron.\n\nLevel 0: Esmeralda\n\nNeighbors of Esmeralda: Magaly, Quin, Ayden.\n\nSo, the first possible steps are to Magaly, Quin, or Ayden.\n\nBut the question is whether she should go to Ayden or Magaly first. So I'll check both paths.\n\nPath 1: Esmeralda -> Ayden\n\nAyden's friends: Isiah, Quin, Esmeralda, Malak.\n\nFrom Ayden, we can go to Isiah, Quin, or Malak.\n\nIsiah