  [1033/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Malcom should pass the message to Joziah or Francesca to get to Esmeralda the fastest. I remember that BFS is used for finding the shortest path in an unweighted graph, so I'll apply that here.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the friendships to build the graph. Let me list out all the connections:\n\n- Joziah is friends with Kendra.\n- Kendra is friends with Joziah, Malcom, and Magaly.\n- Malcom is friends with Joziah, Kandi, and Francesca.\n- Francesca is friends with Malcom and Malc.\n- Malc is friends with Joziah, Kandi, and Sima.\n- Sima is friends with Esteban and Malc.\n- Esteban is friends with Sima and Kandi.\n- Kandi is friends with Joziah, Esteban, and Malc.\n- Malak is friends with Ayden, Quin, and Esmeralda.\n- Ayden is friends with Malak, Quin, and Esmeralda.\n- Quin is friends with Ayden, Malak, and Esmeralda.\n- Esmeralda is friends with Ayden, Malak, Quin, and Magaly.\n- Magaly is friends with Kandi, Esmeralda, and Kend.\n- Kend is friends with Joziah, Esteban, and Magaly.\n- Esteban is friends with Sima and Kend.\n- Sima is friends with Esteban and Malc.\n- Cam is friends with Isiah and Joz.\n- Isiah is friends with Cam and Ayden.\n- Cam is friends with Isiah and Joz.\n- Joz is friends with Cam and Isiah.\n- Isiah is friends with Cam and Ayden.\n- Cam is friends with Isiah and Joz.\n- Joz is friends with Cam and Isiah.\n\nWait, that's a bit confusing. Maybe I should create an adjacency list for each person.\n\nLet me start with Malcom. He is friends with Joziah, Kandi, and Francesca. So, from Malcom, the first step is to check Joziah and Francesca.\n\nIf Malcom sends the message to Joziah, Joziah is friends with Kend, Esteban, and Malc. Then, from Joziah, we can go to Kend, Esteban, or Malc. But we're looking for Esmeralda, so let's see if any of these are connected to Esmeralda.\n\nWait, looking back, Esmeralda is friends with Ayden, Malak, Quin, and Magaly. So, none of Joziah's friends are directly connected to Esmeralda. So, the next step would be to go from Joziah to Kend, Esteban, or Malc.\n\nIf Malcom sends to Joziah, the path would be Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Esteban -> Sima -> Malc -> ... Hmm, that seems like it's getting longer.\n\nAlternatively, if Malcom sends to Francesca, Francesca is friends with Malcom and Malc. So, from Francesca, we go to Malc. Malc is friends with Joz, Kend, and Sima. From Malc, we can go to Joz, Kend, or Sima.\n\nWait, Sima is friends with Esteban and Malc. So, from Sima, we can go to Esteban. Esteban is friends with Kend and Sima. So, from Esteban, we can go to Kend. Kend is friends with Joz and Magaly. Magaly is friends with Kandi and Esmeralda.\n\nWait, so from Malcom -> Francesca -> Malc -> Sima -> Esteban -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda. That's 7 steps.\n\nBut if Malcom sends to Joziah, then Joziah is friends with Kend, Esteban, and Malc. From Kend, we can go to Esteban. From Esteban, to Sima. From Sima to Malc. From Malc to Joz, Kend, or Sima. Hmm, this seems like it's taking longer.\n\nWait, maybe I'm missing something. Let me try to map it out step by step.\n\nStarting with Malcom:\n\nOption 1: Malcom -> Joziah\n\nFrom Joziah, friends are Kend, Esteban, Malc.\n\nSo, next level: Kend, Esteban, Malc.\n\nFrom Kend, friends are Joz, Esteban, Magaly.\n\nFrom Esteban, friends are Sima, Kend.\n\nFrom Malc, friends are Joz, Kend, Sima.\n\nSo, after two steps, we have Kend, Esteban, Malc.\n\nFrom Kend, we can go to Magaly, who is friends with Esmeralda.\n\nSo, path would be Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda. That's 4 steps.\n\nOption 2: Malcom -> Francesca\n\nFrom Francesca, friends are Malcom and Malc.\n\nFrom Malc, friends are Joz, Kend, Sima.\n\nFrom Sima, friends are Esteban, Malc.\n\nFrom Esteban, friends are Sima, Kend.\n\nFrom Kend, friends are Joz, Esteban, Magaly.\n\nFrom Magaly, friends are Kend, Esmeralda.\n\nSo, path would be Malcom -> Francesca -> Malc -> Sima -> Esteban -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda. That's 7 steps.\n\nWait, but maybe there's a shorter path through Malc. Let me check again.\n\nFrom Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda: 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda.\n\nIs there a shorter path? Let's see.\n\nWait, maybe from Joziah, Kend is connected to Magaly, who is connected to Esmeralda. So, that's 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda.\n\nBut wait, is there a way to get to Esmeralda in 3 steps?\n\nLooking back, maybe from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda.\n\nWait, but maybe from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, is there a shorter path through another route?\n\nWait, maybe from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda.\n\nWait, but maybe from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda.\n\nWait, but maybe from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda.\n\nWait, but maybe from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda.\n\nWait, but maybe from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda.\n\nWait, but maybe from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda.\n\nWait, but maybe from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda.\n\nWait, but maybe from Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -> Magaly -> Esmeralda is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Malcom -> Joziah -> Kend -