  [1079/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Tessa should pass the message to Jayceon or Freddy based on the given friendship graph. The question is asking which option is more efficient, so I should probably use BFS to find the shortest path from Tessa to Raymond.\n\nFirst, I'll list out all the connections. Tessa is friends with Jayceon and Freddy. So from Tessa, the first step is either Jayceon or Freddy. Let's explore both paths.\n\nIf Tessa goes to Jayceon first, then Jayceon is connected to Yechezkel, Harlow, and Tessa. Wait, but Tessa is already there, so we can ignore that. From Jayceon, the next step is Yechezkel and Harlow. Let's see where that leads. Yechezkel is friends with JAYCEON and Journey. Journey is friends with Ruth, Vihaan, and Yechezkel. From Journey, Ruth is connected to Mya and Vihaan. Mya is connected to Ruth, Aidan, and Vihaan. Aidan is connected to Mya and Litzy. Litzy is connected to Vihaan and Harlow. Harlow is connected to Claudio and JAYCEON. Claudio is connected to FreDDY and Harlow. FreDDY is connected to Raymond and Tessa. So from Tessa -> Jayceon -> Journey -> Ruth -> Mya -> Aidan -> Litzy -> Harlow -> Claudio -> FreDDY -> Raymond. That's a long path, 10 steps.\n\nAlternatively, if Tessa goes to Freddy first, then Freddy is connected to Tessa, RaymonD, and Claudio. From Freddy, RaymonD is connected to Raymond and Claudio. Claudio is connected to Harlow and FreDDY. Harlow is connected to Claudio, JAYCEON, and Litzy. Litzy is connected to Harlow and Vihaan. Vihaan is connected to Mya, Journey, and FreDDY. Journey is connected to Ruth, Vihaan, and Yechezkel. Ruth is connected to Mya and Vihaan. Mya is connected to Ruth, Aidan, and Vihaan. Aidan is connected to Mya and Litzy. So from Tessa -> Freddy -> RaymonD -> Raymond. That's a direct path of 3 steps.\n\nComparing both paths, the second option is much shorter. So Tessa should pass the message to Freddy first.\n</think>\n\nthe shortest path is tessa -> freddy -> raymond. freddy.\n\nfreddy"  correct=freddy
