audio passes to Freddy, Freddy can go to Tessa, who is connected to Jayceon. So that would be two steps: Claudio -> Freddy -> Tessa -> Jayceon. That's three steps, which is longer.\n\nTherefore, the shortest path is Claudio -> Harlow -> Jayceon. So Claudio should pass to Harlow first.\n</think>\n\nharlow"  correct=harlow
