ourney (step1), and Journey is already there. So no new nodes.\n\nFrom Mya: Aidan, Ruth (step0), Vihaan (step1). So add Aidan.\n\nSo step2: Yechezkel, Aidan.\n\nNow, step3: From Yechezkel: Tessa, Journey (step1), Ruth (step0). So add Tessa.\n\nFrom Aidan: Mya (step1), Journey (step1). So no new nodes.\n\nSo step3: Tessa.\n\nStep4: From Tessa: Freddy, Jayceon, and Harlow.\n\nSo step4: Freddy, Jayceon, Harlow.\n\nNow, Jayceon is in step4, so the shortest path from Ruth to Jayceon is 4 steps.\n\nBut wait, let's see if there's a shorter path.\n\nAlternatively, if Ruth sends to Vihaan first, then:\n\nStep0: Ruth\n\nStep1: Vihaan, Journey, Mya\n\nStep2: From Vihaan: Mya (step1), Ruth (step0), Journey (step1). So no new nodes.\n\nWait, no, from Vihaan, we can go to Mya, but Mya is already in step1. So step2 doesn't add anything.\n\nWait, but Mya is connected to Aidan, so from Mya, we can go to Aidan in step2.\n\nSo step2: Aidan.\n\nFrom Aidan: Mya (step1), Journey (step1). So no new nodes.\n\nSo step3: From Journey: Yechezkel, Vihaan (step1), Ruth (step0). So add Yechezkel.\n\nFrom Mya: Aidan (step2), Ruth (step0), Vihaan (step1). So no new nodes.\n\nSo step3: Yechezkel.\n\nStep4: From Yechezkel: Tessa, Journey (step1), Ruth (step0). So add Tessa.\n\nStep5: From Tessa: Freddy, Jayceon, Harlow.\n\nSo step5: Freddy, Jayceon, Harlow.\n\nSo the shortest path from Ruth to Jayceon is 5 steps if she starts with Vihaan.\n\nBut earlier, when starting with Journey, she reached Jayceon in 4 steps.\n\nWait, but in the first scenario, starting with Journey, she reached Jayceon in 4 steps, but in the second scenario, starting with Vihaan, she reached Jayceon in 5 steps. So the shortest path is through Journey.\n\nWait, but in the first scenario, from Ruth->Journey->Yechezkel, but Yechezkel is connected to Tessa, who is connected to Jayceon. So that's 3 steps: Ruth->Journey->Yechezkel->Tessa->Jayceon. Wait, no, that's 4 steps.\n\nWait, no, from Ruth to Journey is 1, Journey to Yechezkel is 2, Yechezkel to Tessa is 3, Tessa to Jayceon is 4. So 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Ruth to Mya (1), Mya to Aidan (2), Aidan to Journey (3), Journey to Yechezkel (4), Yechezkel to Tessa (5), Tessa to Jayceon (6). That's longer.\n\nWait, but maybe there's a shorter path through Mya and Aidan.\n\nWait, Mya is connected to Aidan, who is connected to Journey, who is connected to Ruth, but that's not helpful.\n\nWait, perhaps I'm missing a connection. Let me check the connections again.\n\nFrom Mya, we can go to Aidan, who is connected to Journey, who is connected to Ruth, but that's not helpful for reaching Jayceon.\n\nWait, perhaps from Mya, we can go to Aidan, who is connected to Journey, who is connected to Yechezkel, who is connected to Tessa, who is connected to Jayceon. That's 5 steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Mya, we can go to Aidan, but that's not helpful.\n\nWait, maybe I'm overcomplicating. The BFS from Ruth would explore all nodes at distance 1, then 2, etc.\n\nSo starting from Ruth:\n\nLevel 0: Ruth\n\nLevel 1: Journey, Vihaan, Mya\n\nLevel 2: From Journey: Yechezkel, Vihaan (already in level1), Ruth (already in level0). So add Yechezkel.\n\nFrom Vihaan: Mya (level1), Journey (level1), and Journey is already there. So no new nodes.\n\nFrom Mya: Aidan, Ruth (level0), Vihaan (level1). So add Aidan.\n\nLevel 2: Yechezkel, Aidan.\n\nLevel 3: From Yechezkel: Tessa, Journey (level1), Ruth (level0). So add Tessa.\n\nFrom Aidan: Mya (level1), Journey (level1). So no new nodes.\n\nLevel 3: Tessa.\n\nLevel 4: From Tessa: Freddy, Jayceon, Harlow.\n\nSo level4: Freddy, Jayceon, Harlow.\n\nSo the shortest path from Ruth to Jayceon is 4 steps: Ruth->Journey->Yechezkel->Tessa->Jayceon.\n\nAlternatively, if Ruth starts with Vihaan, she can reach Mya, then Aidan, then Journey, then Yechezkel, then Tessa, then Jayceon. That's 6 steps, which is longer.\n\nSo the shortest path is through Journey, so Ruth should pass to Journey first.\n</think>\n\nThe shortest path from Ruth 