  [1109/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Jayceon should pass the message to Tessa or Yechezkel to reach Ruth the fastest. I remember that BFS is used for finding the shortest path in an unweighted graph, so I'll apply that here.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the connections. Let's see, Jayceon is friends with Yechezkel and Tessa. So from Jayceon, the first step is to check Tessa and Yechezkel. \n\nLooking at Tessa, she's friends with Freddy and Jayceon. Freddy is connected to Raymond and Claudio. Raymond is friends with Claudio and someone else. Claudio is connected to Freddy, Harlow, and Tessa. Harlow is friends with Claudio and Jayceon. So from Tessa, the path to Ruth goes through Freddy, then Raymond, then maybe someone else. But wait, Ruth is connected to Mya and Vihaan, and Vihaan is connected to Mya and Journey. Journey is connected to Ruth, Yechezkel, and Vihaan. So from Tessa, going through Freddy to Raymond, then to someone else, but that might not reach Ruth quickly.\n\nNow looking at Yechezkel, he's connected to Jayceon and Journey. Journey is connected to Ruth, so that's a direct path. So from Jayceon to Yechezkel, then to Journey, then to Ruth. That's a path of length 3.\n\nWait, but from Tessa, can I reach Ruth faster? Let's see: Tessa is connected to Freddy, who is connected to Raymond, who is connected to Claudio, who is connected to Harlow, who is connected to Jayceon. That doesn't seem helpful. Alternatively, Tessa to Freddy to Yechezkel? No, Freddy is connected to Yechezkel? Wait, no, Freddy is connected to Raymond and Claudio, not directly to Yechezkel. So maybe Tessa to Freddy to Raymond to Claudio to Harlow to Jayceon, but that's going back. Hmm, maybe I'm missing something.\n\nWait, maybe from Tessa, she's connected to Freddy, who is connected to Yechezkel? No, Freddy is connected to Raymond and Claudio, not directly to Yechezkel. So from Tessa, the path to Ruth would go through Freddy, then Raymond, then maybe someone else. But that might take longer.\n\nAlternatively, from Yechezkel, he's connected to Journey, who is connected to Ruth. So that's a two-step path: Jayceon -> Yechezkel -> Journey -> Ruth. That's three steps, but maybe that's the shortest.\n\nWait, but from Tessa, can I reach Ruth in two steps? Tessa is connected to Freddy, who is connected to Raymond, who is connected to Claudio, who is connected to Harlow, who is connected to Jayceon. That doesn't help. Alternatively, Tessa to Freddy to Yechezkel? No, Freddy isn't connected to Yechezkel. So maybe Tessa can't reach Ruth in two steps. So the shortest path from Jayceon to Ruth is through Yechezkel, which is three steps: Jayceon -> Yechezkel -> Journey -> Ruth.\n\nWait, but maybe there's a shorter path through Tessa. Let me check again. Tessa is connected to Freddy, who is connected to Raymond, who is connected to Claudio, who is connected to Harlow, who is connected to Jayceon. That's a loop. Alternatively, Tessa to Freddy to Raymond to Claudio to Harlow to Jayceon, but that's not helpful. So maybe the only way is through Yechezkel.\n\nWait, but maybe I'm missing a connection. Let me check the connections again. Yechezkel is friends with Journey. Journey is friends with Ruth, Vihaan, and Yechezkel. So from Yechezkel to Journey to Ruth. So that's two steps from Yechezkel to Ruth. So from Jayceon to Yechezkel is one step, then to Journey is two, then to Ruth is three. So the path is Jayceon -> Yechezkel -> Journey -> Ruth.\n\nAlternatively, from Tessa, can I reach Ruth in two steps? Tessa to Freddy to Raymond to Claudio to Harlow to Jayceon, but that's not helpful. Alternatively, Tessa to Freddy to Raymond to someone else. Wait, Raymond is connected to Claudio and someone else. Claudio is connected to Harlow and Tessa. Harlow is connected to Claudio and Jayceon. So from Tessa, going through Freddy to Raymond to Claudio to Harlow to Jayceon, but that's not helpful. So maybe the only way is through Yechezkel.\n\nWait, but maybe