would be Ruth -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Tessa? Wait, no, Yechezkel is friends with Tessa? Or is Tessa friends with Freddy and Jayceon, who are connected to Freddy, who is connected to Raymond, who is connected to Claudia, who is connected to Tessa. So maybe the path is Ruth -> Vihaan -> Mya -> Ruth? No, that's not right.\n\nWait, maybe I'm overcomplicating. Let me try to map it out properly. Ruth is connected to J and V. From J, she can go to Y and V. From V, she can go to M and A. From Y, she can go to T. So the path Ruth -> J -> Y -> T is three steps. Alternatively, Ruth -> V -> M -> R -> C -> T? That's five steps. So the shortest path is through J, then Y, then T. So the path is Ruth -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Tessa. But wait, is Yechezkel directly connected to Tessa? Yes, according to the data. So the shortest path is three steps: Ruth -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Tessa.\n\nAlternatively, if Ruth passes to Vihaan, then Vihaan can pass to Mya, who can pass to Ruth, but that's a cycle. Or Vihaan can pass to Aidan, who can pass to Mya or Vihaan again. So the path through Vihaan would be longer. Therefore, the shortest path is through Journey.\n</think>\n\nThe shortest path from Ruth to Tessa is Ruth -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Tessa. Therefore, Ruth should pass the message to Journey.\n\njourney tessa"  correct=journey
