  [1146/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Tessa should pass the message to Jayceon or Freddy first to get it to Vihaan as efficiently as possible. The question is asking which of these two options is shorter in terms of the number of steps in the friendship graph.\n\nFirst, I'll try to visualize the graph based on the given friendships. Let me list out all the connections:\n\n- Ruth is friends with Journey, Vihaan, Mya.\n- Freddy is friends with Raymond, Tessa, Vihaan, Claudio.\n- Jayceon is friends with Tessa, Yechezkel, Harlow.\n- Claudio is friends with Freddy, Harlow, Raymond.\n- Mya is friends with Ruth, Aidan, Vihaan.\n- Aidan is friends with Mya, Litzy.\n- Litzy is friends with Aidan, Vihaan.\n- Yechezkel is friends with Journey, Jayceon.\n- Tessa is friends with Freddy, Jayceon, Claudio, Harlow.\n\nSo, Tessa is connected to Freddy, Jayceon, Claudio, and Harlow. I need to find the shortest path from Tessa to Vihaan.\n\nLet me start by considering Tessa's direct friends:\n\n1. Freddy: Tessa -> Freddy. Freddy is connected to Vihaan, so that's one step away. So the path would be Tessa -> Freddy -> Vihaan. That's two steps.\n\n2. Jayceon: Tessa -> Jayceon. Jayceon is connected to Harlow and Claudio. Claudio is connected to Freddy. So from Jayceon, we can go to Claudio, then to Freddy, then to Vihaan. That's three steps: Tessa -> Jayceon -> Claudio -> Freddy -> Vihaan.\n\nAlternatively, Jayceon is connected to Harlow, who is connected to Ruth, who is connected to Vihaan. So that's Tessa -> Jayceon -> Harlow -> Ruth -> Vihaan. That's also four steps.\n\nSo the shortest path through Jayceon is three steps, but through Freddy, it's just two steps. Therefore, Freddy is the shorter path.\n\nWait, but let me double-check. Is there any other path through Jayceon that's shorter? Let's see:\n\nFrom Tessa to Jayceon, then to Claudio, then to Freddy, then to Vihaan. That's four steps. Alternatively, Tessa to Jayceon to Harlow to Ruth to Vihaan, which i